  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xe4;dda Barnen EU-Bangladesh 2021-2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the Children EU-Bangladesh 2021-2024 - R&#xe4;dda Barnen EU-Bangladesh 2021-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens &#xf6;vergripande syfte &#xe4;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla kortsiktig samt l&#xe5;ngsiktig f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring f&#xf6;r krisdrabbade barn och deras familjer i Cox&apos;s Bazar, Bangladesh. Det specifika syftet &#xe4;r att Rohingya-barn och deras familjer ska f&#xe5; f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad livskvalitet genom &#xf6;kat skydd och utbildningsm&#xf6;jligheter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general aim of the contribution is to ensure short-term and long-term improvement for crisis-stricken children and their families in Cox&apos;s Bazar, Bangladesh. The specific purpose is for Rohingya children and their families to have an improved quality of life through increased protection and educational opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Overall objective: Ensure immediate and lasting change in the lives of displaced and crisis affected children and their families through lifesaving humanitarian assistance.

The specific objective: The lives of displaced and crisis affected Rohingya children and their families and adjacent host communities are improved through child protection and education service in Cox&apos;s Bazar.</narrative>
  </description>
